 "response": {
  "text": "Haan, **₹2,000 ke budget mein achhi branded men's jeans mil jaati hai**. Meri preference quality + fit + value ke hisaab se:\n\n1. **Levi's — Best overall** ⭐  \n   Sale mein Levi's ke 513 Slim Straight ₹1,679, 511 ₹1,935 aur 505 Straight ₹1,975 ke aas-paas mil rahe hain. [levi.in](https://levi.in/collections/men-jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)  \n   ### [Levi's Men's 511 Slim Fit Mid Rise Jeans]()\n*₹3,791*  \n   **Agar ₹1,700–2,000 mein Levi's mil rahi hai, main ise first choice rakhunga.**\n\n2. **Pepe Jeans — Best value/premium feel**  \n   Official site par kaafi models sale mein ₹1,499–₹1,999 ke range mein hain. [www.pepejeans.in](https://www.pepejeans.in/men/jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)  \n   ### [Pepe Jeans Men's Holborne Mid Rise Straight Jeans]()\n*₹1,359.15*\n\n3. **Lee — Comfortable & durable**  \n   ₹2,000 ke andar sale options mil sakte hain; current results mein Lee jeans ₹1,300–₹1,895 range mein dikh rahi hain.  \n   ### [Lee Men's Rodeo Straight Fit Stretchable Jeans]()\n*₹1,450*\n\n4. **Roadster — Best budget option** 💰  \n   Agar ₹700–₹1,200 mein jeans chahiye, Roadster ka value kaafi achha hai. Current options roughly ₹550–₹1,000 mein mil rahe hain. [magicpin.in](https://magicpin.in/blog/category/fashion/top-jeans-brands-in-india-men?utm_source=chatgpt.com)  \n   ### [Roadster Men's Straight Fit Jeans]()\n*₹998*\n\n### [Roadster Men's Slim Jeans]()\n*₹567*\n\n### [Roadster Men's Tapered Fit Mid-Rise Jeans]()\n*₹730*\n\n5. **Highlander — Cheapest decent option**  \n   ₹500–₹800 range mein options mil rahe hain, lekin **Levi's/Pepe/Lee ki sale mil rahi ho toh main unhe prefer karunga**.  \n\n### Meri ranking\n**Levi's > Pepe Jeans > Lee > Roadster > Highlander**\n\nAgar aap **₹2,000 mein ek hi jeans** lene wale ho, toh **dark blue/indigo, straight ya slim-straight fit** lo—sabse versatile rahegi.\n\nAgar bata do **aapki age, height, weight aur slim/normal/thick body type**, toh main aapke liye **exact fit + 3 best jeans** shortlist kar sakta hoon.",
